{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7125323767844495674,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Underscores in Numeric Literals",
      "source_hash": 15267443903186536818,
      "context_hash": 2453387005782490206,
      "translation": "숫자 리터럴의 밑줄",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029405Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract and Rationale",
      "source_hash": 11093403076122541368,
      "context_hash": 15588259884562108555,
      "translation": "초록 및 근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP proposes to extend Python's syntax and number-from-string constructors so that underscores can be used as visual separators for digit grouping purposes in integral, floating-point and complex number literals.",
      "source_hash": 841193005815974348,
      "context_hash": 16182271343717813959,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 정수, 부동 소수점, 복소수 리터럴에서 밑줄을 자릿수 그룹화를 위한 시각적 구분자로 사용할 수 있도록 파이썬의 문법과 문자열로부터 숫자를 만드는 생성자를 확장할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is a common feature of other modern languages, and can aid readability of long literals, or literals whose value should clearly separate into parts, such as bytes or words in hexadecimal notation.",
      "source_hash": 8875496076264660685,
      "context_hash": 16037659323656115165,
      "translation": "이는 다른 현대 언어에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 기능으로, 긴 리터럴이나 16진수 표기법의 바이트 또는 워드처럼 값이 명확하게 부분으로 나뉘어야 하는 리터럴의 가독성을 높이는 데 도움이 될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029406Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples",
      "source_hash": 2926230321239078022,
      "context_hash": 5655570170804946870,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Specification",
      "source_hash": 12978730460824815227,
      "context_hash": 13438780116700492647,
      "translation": "명세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The current proposal is to allow one underscore between digits, and after base specifiers in numeric literals.",
      "source_hash": 17770460016136379494,
      "context_hash": 3957123773571689630,
      "translation": "현재 제안은 숫자 리터럴에서 숫자 사이와 진법 지정자 뒤에 밑줄 하나를 허용하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The underscores have no semantic meaning, and literals are parsed as if the underscores were absent.",
      "source_hash": 7583170389638864717,
      "context_hash": 11258047583399677860,
      "translation": "밑줄은 의미상 아무런 뜻이 없으며, 리터럴은 밑줄이 없는 것처럼 구문 분석됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029407Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Literal Grammar",
      "source_hash": 2799107207942060573,
      "context_hash": 11500372573776984509,
      "translation": "리터럴 문법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The production list for integer literals would therefore look like this",
      "source_hash": 6571719626215910036,
      "context_hash": 7550161402799548730,
      "translation": "따라서 정수 리터럴의 생성 규칙 목록은 다음과 같습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For floating-point and complex literals",
      "source_hash": 6166398437992626971,
      "context_hash": 16093520111912485623,
      "translation": "부동 소수점 및 복소수 리터럴의 경우",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Constructors",
      "source_hash": 16804404533850999754,
      "context_hash": 5749304728691174761,
      "translation": "생성자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Following the same rules for placement, underscores will be allowed in the following constructors:",
      "source_hash": 16983143024748990730,
      "context_hash": 11690490247336955607,
      "translation": "배치에 관한 같은 규칙에 따라, 다음 생성자에서 밑줄이 허용됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``int()`` (with any base)",
      "source_hash": 3710128691743725605,
      "context_hash": 13102288847774654716,
      "translation": "``int()`` (모든 진법)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "``float()``",
      "source_hash": 7450679915218886528,
      "context_hash": 9038637517881288405,
      "translation": "``float()``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029408Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "``complex()``",
      "source_hash": 14804244572719387549,
      "context_hash": 8365917089980601575,
      "translation": "``complex()``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``Decimal()``",
      "source_hash": 1832664243839112691,
      "context_hash": 8493696967734623679,
      "translation": "``Decimal()``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Further changes",
      "source_hash": 15636803254554608785,
      "context_hash": 10048826102516655090,
      "translation": "추가 변경 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The new-style number-to-string formatting language will be extended to allow ``_`` as a thousands separator, where currently only ``,`` is supported.",
      "source_hash": 9438377267778159872,
      "context_hash": 15973141212222989946,
      "translation": "새로운 스타일의 숫자-문자열 포매팅 언어는 현재 ``,``\\ 만 지원하는 천 단위 구분자로 ``_``\\ 도 허용하도록 확장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This can be used to easily generate code with more readable literals.  [11]_",
      "source_hash": 6230921387428337825,
      "context_hash": 4447457274753030478,
      "translation": "이를 사용하면 더 읽기 쉬운 리터럴이 포함된 코드를 쉽게 생성할 수 있습니다.  [11]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The syntax would be the same as for the comma, e.g. ``{:10_}`` for a width of 10 with ``_`` separator.",
      "source_hash": 1448927727727017435,
      "context_hash": 14720361677424517151,
      "translation": "문법은 쉼표의 경우와 같습니다. 예를 들어 ``{:10_}``\\ 는 너비 10에 ``_`` 구분자를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For the ``b``, ``x`` and ``o`` format specifiers, ``_`` will be allowed and group by 4 digits.",
      "source_hash": 3018563396534855447,
      "context_hash": 5010499454906441453,
      "translation": "``b``, ``x``, ``o`` 형식 지정자에서는 ``_``\\ 가 허용되며 4자리씩 그룹화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Prior Art",
      "source_hash": 13769606215757599510,
      "context_hash": 11701502164560244148,
      "translation": "선행 사례",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Those languages that do allow underscore grouping implement a large variety of rules for allowed placement of underscores.",
      "source_hash": 535773601929000319,
      "context_hash": 3456906043139528207,
      "translation": "밑줄 그룹화를 허용하는 언어들은 밑줄을 둘 수 있는 위치에 대해 매우 다양한 규칙을 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029409Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "In cases where the language spec contradicts the actual behavior, the actual behavior is listed.  (\"single\" or \"multiple\" refer to allowing runs of consecutive underscores.)",
      "source_hash": 40111651337206169,
      "context_hash": 16525902626907031224,
      "translation": "언어 명세가 실제 동작과 모순되는 경우에는 실제 동작을 기재합니다.  (\"단일\" 또는 \"다중\"은 연속된 밑줄을 허용하는지를 나타냅니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Ada: single, only between digits [8]_",
      "source_hash": 1116191851724650477,
      "context_hash": 10341207118217525361,
      "translation": "Ada: 단일, 숫자 사이에서만 [8]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "C# (open proposal for 7.0): multiple, only between digits [6]_",
      "source_hash": 6668628645909406988,
      "context_hash": 2892343796851638839,
      "translation": "C# (7.0을 위한 공개 제안): 다중, 숫자 사이에서만 [6]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "C++14: single, between digits (different separator chosen) [1]_",
      "source_hash": 14914728232250687522,
      "context_hash": 10564583329349382696,
      "translation": "C++14: 단일, 숫자 사이 (다른 구분자 채택) [1]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "D: multiple, anywhere, including trailing [2]_",
      "source_hash": 6258937078710305740,
      "context_hash": 5451380669266779961,
      "translation": "D: 다중, 끝을 포함하여 어디서나 [2]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Java: multiple, only between digits [7]_",
      "source_hash": 2002430478977831244,
      "context_hash": 7829175853733159585,
      "translation": "Java: 다중, 숫자 사이에서만 [7]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Julia: single, only between digits (but not in float exponent parts) [9]_",
      "source_hash": 5390318367534698928,
      "context_hash": 17930600640207954716,
      "translation": "Julia: 단일, 숫자 사이에서만 (단, 부동 소수점 지수 부분에서는 불가) [9]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Perl 5: multiple, basically anywhere, although docs say it's restricted to one underscore between digits [3]_",
      "source_hash": 13108599227878901562,
      "context_hash": 15017747756268970251,
      "translation": "Perl 5: 다중, 기본적으로 어디서나 (문서에는 숫자 사이에 밑줄 하나로 제한된다고 되어 있음) [3]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:48.029410Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Ruby: single, only between digits (although docs say \"anywhere\") [10]_",
      "source_hash": 6150331056772644099,
      "context_hash": 3141038256573780164,
      "translation": "Ruby: 한 개, 숫자 사이에만 허용(문서에는 \"어디에나\"라고 되어 있음) [10]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust: multiple, anywhere, except for between exponent \"e\" and digits [4]_",
      "source_hash": 14951870960700841283,
      "context_hash": 1221386729200563531,
      "translation": "Rust: 여러 개, 어디에나 허용하지만 지수 \"e\"와 숫자 사이는 제외 [4]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Swift: multiple, between digits and trailing (although textual description says only \"between digits\") [5]_",
      "source_hash": 13702587053534191624,
      "context_hash": 10987995224039743062,
      "translation": "Swift: 여러 개, 숫자 사이와 끝에 허용(설명 문구에는 \"숫자 사이\"에만 허용한다고 되어 있음) [5]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Alternative Syntax",
      "source_hash": 11785922926867866541,
      "context_hash": 16084354571145878185,
      "translation": "대안 문법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856347Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Underscore Placement Rules",
      "source_hash": 1151543982480487737,
      "context_hash": 14738768780756512640,
      "translation": "밑줄 배치 규칙",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of the relatively strict rule specified above, the use of underscores could be less limited.",
      "source_hash": 466354739747135094,
      "context_hash": 9864241117252488832,
      "translation": "위에서 명시한 비교적 엄격한 규칙 대신, 밑줄 사용을 덜 제한할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "As seen in other languages, common rules include:",
      "source_hash": 9672285569968002029,
      "context_hash": 6809244087944050073,
      "translation": "다른 언어에서 볼 수 있듯이, 흔히 쓰이는 규칙은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Only one consecutive underscore allowed, and only between digits.",
      "source_hash": 17950750383410341540,
      "context_hash": 15414252407978506209,
      "translation": "연속된 밑줄은 한 개만, 숫자 사이에서만 허용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Multiple consecutive underscores allowed, but only between digits.",
      "source_hash": 1409759657689394266,
      "context_hash": 9950472648434910503,
      "translation": "연속된 밑줄을 여러 개 허용하지만, 숫자 사이에서만 허용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Multiple consecutive underscores allowed, in most positions except for the start of the literal, or special positions like after a decimal point.",
      "source_hash": 15541004642710301816,
      "context_hash": 10409272416293500607,
      "translation": "연속된 밑줄을 여러 개 허용하며, 리터럴의 시작이나 소수점 뒤와 같은 특수한 위치를 제외한 대부분의 위치에서 허용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The syntax in this PEP has ultimately been selected because it covers the common use cases, and does not allow for syntax that would have to be discouraged in style guides anyway.",
      "source_hash": 9716426592068279618,
      "context_hash": 1025779068224527731,
      "translation": "이 PEP의 문법이 최종적으로 선택된 것은 일반적인 사용 사례를 포괄하면서도, 어차피 스타일 가이드에서 사용을 권장하지 않아야 할 문법은 허용하지 않기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "A less common rule would be to allow underscores only every N digits (where N could be 3 for decimal literals, or 4 for hexadecimal ones).",
      "source_hash": 15450254613517975891,
      "context_hash": 1979554844071417004,
      "translation": "덜 흔한 규칙으로는 N자리마다만 밑줄을 허용하는 방식이 있습니다(N은 10진 리터럴이면 3, 16진 리터럴이면 4일 수 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "This is unnecessarily restrictive, especially considering the separator placement is different in different cultures.",
      "source_hash": 18402730669239719245,
      "context_hash": 48923892230232557,
      "translation": "이는 불필요하게 제한적이며, 특히 구분자 배치가 문화권마다 다르다는 점을 고려하면 더욱 그렇습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856348Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Different Separators",
      "source_hash": 2824480391221837633,
      "context_hash": 2688552897323568090,
      "translation": "다른 구분자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A proposed alternate syntax was to use whitespace for grouping.",
      "source_hash": 13493706451344729163,
      "context_hash": 4202072049258197874,
      "translation": "제안된 대안 문법 중 하나는 그룹 구분에 공백을 사용하는 것이었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Although strings are a precedent for combining adjoining literals, the behavior can lead to unexpected effects which are not possible with underscores.",
      "source_hash": 17012165550071422485,
      "context_hash": 13520192237846535588,
      "translation": "인접한 리터럴을 결합하는 선례로 문자열이 있기는 하지만, 이 동작은 밑줄로는 일어날 수 없는 예기치 않은 결과를 낳을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Also, no other language is known to use this rule, except for languages that generally disregard any whitespace.",
      "source_hash": 8854272949564781536,
      "context_hash": 10965331543723821053,
      "translation": "또한 공백을 전반적으로 무시하는 언어를 제외하면, 이 규칙을 사용하는 다른 언어는 알려져 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "C++14 introduces apostrophes for grouping (because underscores introduce ambiguity with user-defined literals), which is not considered because of the use in Python's string literals. [1]_",
      "source_hash": 5631027990399433996,
      "context_hash": 8523926571877248600,
      "translation": "C++14는 그룹 구분에 아포스트로피를 도입했지만(밑줄은 사용자 정의 리터럴과 모호성을 일으키기 때문), 파이썬의 문자열 리터럴에서 아포스트로피를 사용하므로 고려하지 않습니다. [1]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 8769245832165257364,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A preliminary patch that implements the specification given above has been posted to the issue tracker. [12]_",
      "source_hash": 5728583395160946341,
      "context_hash": 3239115597159088759,
      "translation": "위에서 제시한 명세를 구현하는 예비 패치가 이슈 트래커에 게시되었습니다. [12]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T05:25:49.856349Z",
      "issues": []
    },
